# Control-plane chatbot (session b0c777e3-0955-cd8b-3d01-ca12998cae28):
# hourly model_registry refresh, run as the chatbot through its own lungs.
#
# Install inside the chatbot's container (it needs a cron daemon there). The
# identity sees its lungs at /run/mount/3tchedfs. The supported client invokes
# refresh under the chatbot's existing grant and validates the receipt on the
# same call handle. A failed or uncertain invocation is never retried here.
# Minute 17 keeps it off the top of the hour.
17 * * * * /usr/local/bin/threetched-fs invoke --expected-mode guest-kernel --mount /run/mount/3tchedfs --confirm-side-effects --args '{}' plugins/model_registry/operations/refresh/call
